  "body": "MacOS BigSur 11.2.3\r\n\r\nChrome Version 95.0.4638.54 (Official Build) (x86_64)\r\n\r\nhtml\r\n```html\r\n   <select>\r\n      <option> test </option>\r\n    </select>\r\n```\r\n\r\n```javascript\r\ndevice.addEventListener(\"inputreport\", (e) => {\r\n        const data = e.data.buffer;\r\n        console.log(new Date(), \"received data\", data);\r\n      });\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhen the user click the \"test\" select element to open it, it will stop receiving data.\r\n<img width=\"274\" alt=\"Screenshot 2021-10-28 at 11 47 10 am\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/15373520/139183212-7bfd649b-f27b-4f71-8da6-5a11b68b5f53.png\">\r\n\r\n\r\n[working example on codesandbox](https://codesandbox.io/s/web-hid-stopped-when-select-ele-opened-83cfm?file=/src/index.js:556-705)",
